@startuml
title Phase 1: fixed dispatch
package "main: composition" as Main
package "CLI + static help" as CLI
package "Concrete commands" as Commands
package "ShapeFactory + concrete shapes" as Model
package "XML / filesystem" as IO
Main --> CLI
Main --> Commands
Main --> Model
Main --> IO
CLI --> Commands : Command.execute
Commands --> Model
IO --> Model
note bottom of Model
ShapeFactory enumerates built-in types.
New shapes require factory edits.
end note
@enduml
